  "title": "RBL Bank Expands EMTN Programme with $1 Billion Investment",
  "summary": "RBL Bank approved a $1 billion EMTN Programme to raise overseas debt, enabling foreign-currency bonds, notes, and other permitted debt securities through transactional arrangements. The bank also established a framework for issuing such securities under Regulation S of the US Securities Act 1933.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "RBL Bank approved $1 billion from overseas investors through bond issuance under the EMTN Programme.",
      "confidence": 0.95
